# QA-008: Back-assay vitamin C using an iodine excess and a reagent blank
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 KI 0.002mol
add v1 I2 0.0003mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 KI 0.002mol
add v2 ascorbic_acid 0.0001mol
add v2 I2 0.0003mol
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.0004mol
add v2 Na2S2O3 0.0004mol
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
inspect
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.0002mol
